    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Predict & Run\r\n\r\nLook at the code in the workspace. This program takes a boba order, adds an 18% tip, and splits the total evenly among friends.\r\n\r\nFor these inputs: \r\n- 4 drinks\r\n- $5.50 per drink\r\n- $2.00 coupon\r\n- 3 friends\r\n\r\nWrite down the exact output you expect, line by line, and the final value of every variable.\r\n\r\nPress Run to check your prediction.\r\n\r\nNow run it two more times:\r\n- Enter \"four\" instead of a number when asked how many drinks. What happens?\r\n- Enter 0 when asked how many friends are splitting. What happens?\r\n\r\n",
